{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/llm cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior. Regenerate the tracked environment-variable registry when comment-only source-line shifts change its generated location metadata.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/llm/agent_call.py:1-21, 142-181` — Preserve agent-call responsibility, closure-shared cache, and normalized-path memo semantics. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/anthropic_model.py:1-22, 216-236, 261-286` — Preserve provider construction, loopback bypass, and bounded retry behavior. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/bedrock_model.py:1-24, 45-74, 85-126, 154-159` — Preserve inference-profile requirement, region precedence, ambient auth, retry, and timeout mapping. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/build_drift.py:1-31` — Preserve advisory proven-only ancestry warning and fail-open behavior. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/cache_diagnostics.py:1-16, 36-85, 141-155, 200-222` — Preserve warning predicates and marked-prefix estimate. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/capabilities.py:29-67, 139-154, 180-207, 239-333, 511-523, 565-621, 665-698` — Preserve sourced model limits, conservative defaults, and dispatch invariants. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/code_review/bugfix_size_gate.py:1-35, 57-62` — Preserve 150-line threshold, accepted/infra buckets, and fail-closed posture. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/code_review/carry_forward.py:1-34, 109-126` — Preserve three-state, surfaced-and-grounded-only, carry-once contract. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/completion_reconcile.py:61-65, 140-164, 192-211` — Preserve FAIL/findings normalization, framework-owned fault marker, and evidence remediation selection. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/completion_tool_policy.py:1-31` — Preserve one governed kind per response, shared locking, and finite evidence boundary. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/completion.py:60-77, 264-284` — Preserve standard-class model resolution and criteria-scaled step budget. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/config_binding.py:1-23` — Preserve compose-once binding, reentrant reuse, fail-closed config, and redacted allowlist. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/criteria/ids.py:1-30` — Preserve injective logical-to-prompt mapping and name grammar. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/criteria/snapshot.py:1-28` — Preserve immutable digest-bound policy and repository-wide glob semantics. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/enrich.py:26-31, 42-87` — Preserve model-window bound, visible newline truncation, and idempotence. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/epic_bug_screen.py:1-41, 83-91` — Preserve DET floor/filter, A/B/C screen, cap, and systemic-failure posture. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/code-review-concurrency.eval.yaml:1-27, 87-108` — Preserve scored coverage, epoch tolerance, and deliberately non-gating case. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-container.eval.yaml:1-20, 67-72` — Preserve fixture scope and fidelity tolerance. No programmatic docstring consumer was found. Consumer: none found.\n- `docs/env-vars.md` — Regenerate the environment-variable registry after comment-only source-line shifts; the generator owns its content.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [x] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [x] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n- [x] `docs/env-vars.md` matches `scripts/gen_env_registry.py` after source-line shifts; verified by the generated-documentation check.\n\n## Verification\n- Immutable normalized-AST and directive-attachment guards over every owned source path.\n- Exact one-commit path and whitespace checks over all recorded file-impact paths.\n- Focused tests for the owned LLM modules and their identified consumers.\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/gen_env_registry.py --check`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make typecheck`\n- Gerrit CI runs the full repository test contract before submission.\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788968254274840001,"uuid":"cbc280d9-e9c9-4846-a1b0-5b3ddf7af462"}